- Tempo & Pulse: 42–62 BPM; an ultra-slow, arrhythmic bradycardia pulse characterized by sudden two-second asystolic breath pauses, followed by tiny fluttering micro-clusters that replicate an arctic ground squirrel's dormant circulatory cycle.
- Harmonic Palette: Lydian and Dorian modes rendered in saturated, pale lavender major-7th and suspended chords; detuned analog pads evocative of warm 2003 softsynths running on half-drained laptop batteries.
- Production Signatures: Whistle-choir layering where human tin-whistles are slowed down 400% through vintage spring reverb to become ghostly string sections; sidechain compression keyed to erratic EKG cardiograms that suction the entire mix into sudden hypothermic vacuums; crushed 2000s digital clipping run through tape warmth to simulate sound traveling through dense layers of hand-knitted cable wool.
- Dynamics: Extreme stasis alternating with gentle, shuddering thaws; the music hovers in weightless, airy suspension for whole minutes before exhaling into a dense, cozy wall of saturated, tape-flanged bliss.

